#. module: account_tax_fixed_amount_currency
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_tax_fixed_amount_currency.field_account_tax__currency_id
msgid ""
"When set, the fixed amount is expressed in this currency and will be "
"converted to the document currency at invoice time. Leave empty for the "
"standard behavior (amount in document currency)."
msgstr ""
"Lorsqu'il est défini, le montant fixe est exprimé dans cette devise et sera "
"converti en devise du document lors de la facturation. Laissez vide pour le "
"comportement standard (montant en devise du document)."
